          "abridged": false,
          "author": "Yoto",
          "description": "Welcome aboard Yoto1 — your retro rocket ship through the galaxy. Space Rock fires up the boosters with eight original songs that fuse the heart-thumping spirit of 80s and 90s rock with the awe of space exploration.\n\nThis is rock music launched into orbit, with power chords and thundering drums that feel just as at home in an arena as they do in outer space. From the explosive opening of \"Lift Off\" to the emotional return of \"Going Home,\" the album takes you on a full cosmic adventure without ever losing that rock energy.\n\n\nWritten, recorded, guitar-shredded and drum-beaten by a group of polished UK session musicians in rural England. Led by Tom McCarthy this crew of star gazers also bought us the now legendary Dino Rock Yoto card. All kids deserve proper rocking tunes and Space Rock delivers just that. Crank it up and blast off.\n",
